<section id="goal-setting" class="t-bg-supporting2">      
  <h2>Goal Setting</h2>    
  <p>
    It is important to set yourself achievable targets and specific deadlines. These will keep you focused and increase your chance of overall success. Writing down your goals often gives you greater motivation to achieve them.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Your motivation map</h3>
  <p>
    A Motivation Map has three parts. <a href="~/documents/motivation-map-blank.doc">Download your own motivation map</a> and work your way through the steps below.
  </p>
  
